      "problem": "Convert $\\frac{35}{6}$ into a repeating decimal using long division.",
      "worked_solution": "To write the fraction as a decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator:\n\n$$\n35÷6\n$$\n\nWe proceed using long division as usual, continuing until a repeating pattern of digits appears after the decimal point:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<br><br><table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\">$\\,\\,\\,5\\,.\\,8\\,3\\,3\\,…$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"left\">$\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}5\\,.\\,0\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}0}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td><td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$5$</td> \n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\