idth=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,⋮$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr> \n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe could continue the division, but the same digit keeps repeating. Thus, the decimal continues with repeating $3$'s:\n\n$$\n5.833…\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{35}{6}=5.833…=5.8\\overset{―}{3}.\n$$",
